      "writtenOn": "2025-05-15T22:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest following the common practice of defining functions in a .c file and declaring them in a .h file. I understand there are many bad examples of defining very long functions as static inline functions in a .h file.\n\nWe will need to add the \"av1_\" prefix to these two functions\u0027 names.",
