        "id": 9545
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-15T22:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional: Instead of casting `stride` to `ptrdiff_t`, we can add it to the `src` pointer:\n\n```\n  for (int r \u003d 0; r \u003c rows; ++r) {\n    for (int c \u003d 0; c \u003c cols; ++c) {\n      const uint8_t value \u003d src[c];\n      ...\n    }\n    src +\u003d stride;\n  }\n```\n\nIf you don\u0027t like modifying the function parameter `src`, you can declare a local variable and modify that instead:\n\n```\n  const uint8_t *src_row \u003d src;\n  for (int r \u003d 0; r \u003c rows; ++r) {\n    for (int c \u003d 0; c \u003c cols; ++c) {\n      const uint8_t value \u003d src_row[c];\n      ...\n    }\n    src_row +\u003d stride;\n  }\n```",
      "revId": "8cfef08c7ed1d6a606621a11b7b2d2d3cada4a85",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
